         {
            "category": "description",
            "text": "An issue was discovered in LemonLDAP::NG through 2.0.8, when NGINX is used. An attacker may bypass URL-based access control to protected Virtual Hosts by submitting a non-normalized URI. This also affects versions before 0.5.2 of the \"Lemonldap::NG handler for Node.js\" package.",
            "title": "Vulnerability Description"
         }
